{"id":29440,"slug":"the-touch","title":"The Touch","year":1971,"country":"Sweden","duration":115,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29440-the-touch","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/bc4a7046d2b3d175eaf40c53cef571d9/9EsrVCzvTQTzkv1g2y1JGR7OzumhIG_large.jpg","description":"With his first English-language film, a critical and box-office disaster, Ingmar Bergman delivered a compelling portrait of conflicting desires. In The Touch, a chance encounter between seemingly contented housewife Karin (Bibi Andersson) and David (Elliott Gould), an intense American archaeologist scarred by his family’s past, leads to the initiation of a torrid and tempestuous affair, one that eventually threatens the stability of Karin’s marriage to a respected local surgeon (Max von Sydow). Upon its release, the filmmaker declared this emotionally complex and sensitively performed film to be his first real love story. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Elliott Gould","role":"David Kovac","slug":"elliott-gould"},{"actor":"Bibi Andersson","role":"Karin Vergerus","slug":"bibi-andersson"},{"actor":"Max von Sydow","role":"Andreas Vergerus","slug":"max-von-sydow"},{"actor":"Sheila Reid","role":"Sara Kovac","slug":"sheila-reid"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Lars-Owe Carlberg","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematographer","person":"Sven Nykvist","slug":"sven-nykvist"},{"role":"Music","person":"\u0007Carl Michael Bellman","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Peter Covent","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Jan Johansson","slug":null},{"role":"Editor","person":"Siv Lundgren","slug":null},{"role":"Production design","person":"Ann-Christin Lobråten","slug":null},{"role":"Production design","person":"P. A. Lundgren","slug":null},{"role":"Costume